('O-2026-10-07-CL51-NIGHT-TRIGGER-AND-OWNERSHIP','reconciliation','Choose CL-51 global night trigger and reconcile AmbientLight ownership','All 86 installed AmbientLights are hidden. The campaign night trigger remains undefined, and non-F1/F2 light ownership/group semantics were not established by the read-only inspection.','Obtain explicit GM choice for night trigger; classify and lock each light owner and its region/state, then design read-only preview with independent verified fixture hashes and exact transitions, not a blanket toggle.','User-approved manual trigger, campaign-time event or story event; exact fixture flags/region alignment, daytime ownership and F1/F2 independent encounter-state groups.','P1','blocked','Foreman','S-2026-10-07-CL51-LIGHT-INVENTORY');
